  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-skyblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Enhanced Power Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d1/Momoshiki.png/revision/latest?cb=20151020155059\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Momoshiki\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d1/Momoshiki.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20151020155059\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d1/Momoshiki.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20151020155059 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d1/Momoshiki.png/revision/latest?cb=20151020155059 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Momoshiki\" width=\"270\" height=\"145\" data-image-key=\"Momoshiki.png\" data-image-name=\"Momoshiki.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Momoshiki Ōtsutsuki (Naruto) can absorb any jutsu with his Rinnegan and make them many times more powerful with his own chakra.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb and augment the powers of others.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p>The power to <b>steal and augment the powers of others.</b> Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Superpower_Absorption\" title=\"Superpower Absorption\">Superpower Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Self-Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Self-Power Augmentation\">Self-Power Augmentation</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Power_Replication\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Power Replication\">Enhanced Power Replication</a>.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnhanced_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Enhanced Power/Ability Theft</li>\n<li>Superior Power Absorption</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnhanced_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can not only copy the steal of the <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Powers\" title=\"Category:Powers\">powers</a> of objects and/or subjects but <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Power Augmentation\">augment</a> them to <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Mastering\" title=\"Ability Mastering\">higher levels</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Transcendence\" title=\"Ability Transcendence\">highest levels</a> than the original user, possibly even unlocking undiscovered sub-powers of the stolen powers leading to <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Mixture\" title=\"Power Mixture\">Power Mixture</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnhanced_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Intuitive_Absorption\" title=\"Intuitive Absorption\">Intuitive Absorption</a>: The user can absorb the powers of others and immediately know how to use them, allowing them to possibly have much more control over the absorbed power than the original user. It is also possible that the user will also be much stronger than the original user, being able to do things with the power that the original holder couldn't.\n<ul><li>An example of this would be: If the user stolen <a href=\"/wiki/Electricity_Manipulation\" title=\"Electricity Manipulation\">Electricity Manipulation</a>, the user would understand electricity's connection to <a href=\"/wiki/Magnetism_Manipulation\" title=\"Magnetism Manipulation\">magnetism</a>, allowing the user to gain the full power of <a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetism_Manipulation\" title=\"Electromagnetism Manipulation\">Electromagnetism</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/EM_Spectrum_Manipulation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"EM Spectrum Manipulation\">EM Spectrum Manipulation</a>. Furthermore, the user would also realized Electromagnetism becomes one with <a href=\"/wiki/Weak_Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Weak Force Manipulation\">Weak Force</a> at higher energies, leading to <a href=\"/wiki/Electro-Weak_Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Electro-Weak Force Manipulation\">Electro-Weak Force Manipulation</a> and control over all kinds of <a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Manipulation\" title=\"Radiation Manipulation\">radiations</a></li>\n<li>Another example is: If the user stole <a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Kinetic Energy Manipulation\">Kinetic Energy Manipulation</a>, the user would understand kinetic energy’s connection to other energies, allowing the user to gain the full power of <a href=\"/wiki/Rotational_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Rotational Energy Manipulation\">Rotational Energy Manipulation</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sound_Manipulation\" title=\"Sound Manipulation\">Sound Manipulation</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Thermal_Manipulation\" title=\"Thermal Manipulation\">Thermal Manipulation</a>. It would also allow for <a href=\"/wiki/Intangibility\" title=\"Intangibility\">Intangibility</a>, use it for <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Regeneration\" title=\"Energy Regeneration\">regeneration</a> and much</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Self-Power Augmentation\">Self-Power Augmentation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnhanced_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Power Augmentation\">Power Augmentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Superpower_Manipulation\" title=\"Superpower Manipulation\">Superpower Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnhanced_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May have limited range, including touch only.</li>\n<li>Adaptive Abilities like <a href=\"/wiki/Reactive_Adaptation\" title=\"Reactive Adaptation\">Reactive Adaptation</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Superior_Adaptation\" title=\"Superior Adaptation\">Superior Adaptation</a> could possibly become resistant / immune to the user's power.</li>\n<li>Beings with&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Power_Anchoring\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Anchoring\">Power Anchoring</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption_Immunity\" title=\"Power Absorption Immunity\">Power Absorption Immunity</a>&#160;are immune.&#160;</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnhanced_Power_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Jio Freed (<i>666 Satan/O-Parts Hunter</i>)</li>\n<li>The Hollow (<i>Charmed</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://naruto.fandom.com/wiki/Momoshiki_%C5%8Ctsutsuki\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:naruto:Momoshiki Ōtsutsuki\">Momoshiki Ōtsutsuki</a> (<i>Naruto</i>); via his <a href=\"https://naruto.fandom.com/wiki/Rinnegan\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:naruto:Rinnegan\">Rinnegan</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://naruto.fandom.com/wiki/Boruto_Uzumaki\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:naruto:Boruto Uzumaki\">Boruto Uzumaki</a> (<i>Naruto/Boruto: Naruto Next Generation</i>); via his <a href=\"https://naruto.fandom.com/wiki/K%C4%81ma\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:naruto:Kāma\">Kāma</a> seal</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://naruto.fandom.com/wiki/Hiruko_(missing-nin)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:naruto:Hiruko (missing-nin)\">Hiruko</a> (<i>Naruto</i>); via <a href=\"https://naruto.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Release\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:naruto:Dark Release\">Shade Style/Dark Release</a></li>\n<li>Alkaiser (<i>Saga Frontier</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnhanced_Power_Absorption%3Fveactio